      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794691502938,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* duplicated external entity (drawn twice to avoid crossing lines).  Every process also appends to the ops logs — guard_event, sandbox_event, throttle_window, memory_usage, email_usage — not drawn.\nArrow direction = direction of data. Double-headed arrows read and write.\nP9 reads the user, project, message and export rows (D1–D3) and counts sends in email_usage. P3 and P7 only queue the notify/send event.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* duplicated external entity (drawn twice to avoid crossing lines).  Every process also appends to the ops logs — guard_event, sandbox_event, throttle_window, memory_usage, email_usage — not drawn.\nArrow direction = direction of data. Double-headed arrows read and write.\nP9 reads the user, project, message and export rows (D1–D3) and counts sends in email_usage. P3 and P7 only queue the notify/send event.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
